  "body": "Automated bridge job `RQ-FIX-PHANTOM-4137` (pool: devin-flash), single commit on base `580989590`.\n\n**Tests:** no test command\n\n**Tier-1 (CODEOWNERS) paths, async post-merge review:** .github/CODEOWNERS src/core/memory/reclaim.ts src/core/memory/system-deps.ts src/core/routing/policy.ts src/core/routing/router.ts src/core/routing/task-bandit.ts src/core/routing/types.ts test/config/realio-lane-membership.mjs test/fixtures/authority/tier1-closure.json\n\n<details><summary>Agent notes</summary>\n\n# BRIDGE_NOTES — RQ-FIX-PHANTOM-4137\n\nResolve conflicts / required-CI failures on PR #4137 (`bridge: RQ-DRAIN3-PH-03`).\n\n## What the PR was vs. what master already had\n\nPR #4137 was a single commit (`cf0b3441c7`) on `65d714ece3`, 687 commits behind\nmaster. Most of its content had already landed through later bridge PRs in\nevolved form, so the merge was resolved per-file:\n\n- **Took master's evolved versions** for the duplicated surfaces: `src/core/fleet/rebase-plan.ts`,\n  `src/cli/fleet-rebase-plan.ts`, `test/fleet-rebase-plan.test.ts`,\n  `docs/FLEET-REBASE-PLAN.md` (master added spiral-policy/rework on top via #4121/#4149/#4226),\n  `scripts/docs-sync.mjs`, `test/docs-sync.test.ts`, `scripts/ci/merge-drain.mjs`,\n  `src/cli/chain.ts`, `src/core/fleet/eval-report.ts`, and all generated docs\n  (`docs/cli.md`, `docs/CLI-REFERENCE.md`, `docs/llms.txt`, `site/*`, freshness blocks —\n  regenerated with `node scripts/docs-sync.mjs`).\n- **Kept both sides** where master and the PR added different features in the same\n  spot: `src/core/routing/policy.ts` and `src/core/routing/router.ts` now carry\n  master's task-arms evidence lane AND the PR's task-bandit lane.\n- **Renamed the bandit's arm type** `TaskArm` → `TaskBanditArm` in\n  `src/core/routing/types.ts` / `task-bandit.ts`: master already owns `TaskArm`\n  for the task-arms flag (different shape — optional id, `engine: string`, pace).\n  Without the rename the merged file had duplicate-interface type errors.\n- **Carried forward the PR-only features**: `phm mem reclaim` (`src/cli/mem.ts`,\n  `src/core/memory/{reclaim,system-deps}.ts`, docs/MEM-RECLAIM.md), `phm replay`\n  (`src/cli/replay.ts`, `src/tui/replay.ts`, `src/core/run/job-replay.ts`), the\n  task-bandit lane (`src/core/routing/task-bandit.ts`, `docs/router/task-bandit.md`,\n  `test/task-bandit.test.ts` + fixtures), Connect API-key custody\n  (`apiKeyCatalogResources`, `custodyApiKey`, `/api/connect/keys|key`, ConnectView\n  key forms, `test/connect-key-custody.test.ts`, `test/onb-connect-e2e.test.ts`),\n  readiness `apiKeyCustody` counts, and the `docs/README.md` index rows for the\n  two new docs (absolute URLs per current convention).\n- Re-added `test/onb-connect-e2e.test.ts` to `REAL_IO_TEST_FILES` (the PR's\n  realio-lane entry was lost when master's list won the conflict).\n- `src/cli/index.ts`, `help.ts`, `completions.ts`: master's command table plus the\n  PR's `mem` and `replay` verbs and `mem reclaim` help/completion entries.\n\n## Authority regen\n\n`npm run authority:regen` — new Tier-1 roots (CODEOWNERS review needed):\n`src/core/memory/reclaim.ts`, `src/core/memory/system-deps.ts`,\n`src/core/routing/task-bandit.ts`. Generated `.github/CODEOWNERS` entries for the\nfive new Tier-1 tests and updated `test/fixtures/authority/tier1-closure.json`.\n\n## Commands run\n\n- `git merge --no-commit --no-ff PR4137-head` (25 conflicts, all resolved)\n- `node scripts/docs-sync.mjs` — synchronized (regenerated cli.md, CLI-REFERENCE.md,\n  llms.txt, site/llms-full.txt, CODEMAP.md, freshness version pins)\n- `npm run authority:regen` — pass\n- `node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit` — pass (0 errors)\n- `node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit -p src/web-ui/tsconfig.json` — pass\n- `eslint` on all touched source/test files — pass (0 problems)\n- `node scripts/verify-changed.mjs` — PASS (file selection, authority drift, eslint\n  changed files, tsgo, web typecheck, realio-lane, verse-sync-io, dedupe)\n- `npm run check:docs` — pass (0 errors)\n- `npm run test:ci` — 287 tests passed across: task-bandit (86), mem-reclaim (24),\n  job-replay (20), merge-drain-q9 (15), connect-key-custody (12), onb-connect-e2e (9),\n  router-task-arms (20), routing-bandit (16), routing-seat-router (82),\n  routing-arms (3), m15.router (49), m21.policy (40), router-arms-replay (5),\n  router-eval-harness (29), authority-codeowners-310b + tier1-closure (10)\n- `vitest run --config vitest.config.web.ts ConnectView.test.tsx` — 10/10 pass\n  (one 5s-timeout flake on first run under load; passed clean on re-run)\n- `node scripts/check-realio-lane-membership.mjs` — onb-connect-e2e now listed;\n  remaining flags are pre-existing master files this change does not touch\n\n## Notes / limitations\n\n- Two first-run timeouts (m21.policy ×2, ConnectView ×1) were load flakes; each\n  suite passes standalone. No test was weakened or skipped.\n- `docs/README.md` is hand-maintained; the two new index rows use absolute\n  github.com URLs matching the file's current convention.\n- origin/master advanced 3 commits during the session (RECUTCOMMS/CORE recuts);\n  none touch this change's files, so the merge-queue path stays clean.\n- Net LOC vs master base: 45 files, +5745 / −44 (includes regenerated docs and\n  authority snapshots).\n</details>\n",
